6            device out (6=stdout,7=stderr,file)
1            # of problem sizes (N)
1533952      Ns         (240 A100 + 16 H100 (two 8-way nodes) = 256 GPUs, mixed; sqrt(0.92 * 256 * 80GB / 8B) rounded down to NB multiple)
